# Tribute mini · ossuary (The Ossuary, GIANT, Arcanist) · built 2026-11-03 from uploads/8146efc5f2898d52f8fbb248a0d574c5_tts.obj (Mini Baker; source was -Z-up, faced +Y)
# GIANT tri-hex base + facing marker copied from minis/garran (from minis/aykin: three 2" hexes, lip y 0.10); UVs moved to a flat 230-grey patch of this diffuse/normal (px 152-184, 1992-2024). g base FIRST (player tint), g figure untinted.
# body: stood upright, turned to face -Z, legs centred on the base centroid, sculpted ground y 0.05 -> 0.096, scaled x6.5: top (tombstone / tree) 4.80". Sculpted round ground clipped to the tri-hex outline; ground hidden under the lip dropped.
# 2026-11-05: each base hex inset to 0.9178 of the 2" pitch (flat-to-flat 1.836, was 1.952) so it sits inside the board's painted hex and clear of its face lines; the pivot moved to the REAR hex centre (was the tri-hex centroid; mesh z -1.1547), so TTS grid snapping lands on one hex centre. TTS scale = board pitch / 2 at load (Lua fitMini).
